ate coherent action-conditioned futures; closed-loop benchmarks test whether those predictions remain useful for planning and policy evaluation; diagnostic benchmarks test whether the generated futures are physically grounded, controllable, and executable. Together, they highlight a broader lesson from recent work: no single metric is sufficient for embodied world model evaluation. A strong model must not only predict plausible futures, but also preserve the action-relevant structure needed for reliable control.\n26\n表 3 核心属性 用于具身世界模型训练的代表性数据集/资源的核心属性。仅基准 y 评估部分讨论的资源 不包含在内。\nName Year 来源 X-Emb. Act. 观测/3D 语言 M/C\nRoVid‐X(Deng 等,2026) 2026 真实/机器人视频 – – – ✓ ✗ Open X‐Embodiment(OXE)\n(O’Neill 等,2024) 2024 Real ✓ ✓ – – –\nDROID(Khazatsky 等,2024) 2024 Real ✗ ✓ – ✓ – BridgeData V2(Walke 等,2023) 2023 Real ✗ ✓ – ✓ – AgiBot World(Bu 等,2025a) 2025 Real – ✓ – ✓ – Galaxea Open‐World Datase\n(Jiang 等,2025a) 2025 Real – ✓ – ✓ – Humanoid Everyday(Zhao 等,2025) 2025 Real – ✓ ✓ ✓ ✓ RoboMIND 2.0(Hou 等,2025) 2025 Real+Sim ✓ ✓ – ✓ ✓\nFastUMI‐100K(Liu 等,2025b) 2025 Real – ✓ ✓ ✓ – BRMData(Zhang 等,2024) 2024 Real – ✓ ✓ – – UMI(Chi 等,2024) 2024 Real – ✓ – – ✗ MV‐UMI(Rayyan 等,2025) 2025 Real ✓ ✓ ✓ – ✗ ActiveUMI(Zeng 等,2025) 2025 Real – ✓ ✓ – ✗ TWIST2(Ze 等,2025) 2025 Real – ✓ – ✗ ✗ DexWild(Tao 等,2025) 2025 人类+机器人 ✓ – – ✗ ✗\nEgoMimic(Kareer 等,2025) 2025 人类+机器人 – – ✓ ✗ ✗\nPHSD / In‐N‐On (Cai 等,2025) 2025 人类自我中心 ✗ – – ✗ ✗ UniHand (Luo 等,2025) 2025 人类视频 – – – ✓ ✗ UniHand 2.0 (Luo 等,2026) 2026 人类+机器人+视觉语言模型 ✓ ✓ – ✓ ✗ Hoi!(Engelbracht 等,2025) 2025 人类+机器人 ✓ ✓ ✓ ✗ ✓\nFreeTacMan(Wu 等,2025) 2025 无机器人 – ✓ ✓ ✗ ✓\n人形视觉‐触觉‐动作\n(Kwon 等,2025) 2025 Real ✗ ✓ – ✗ ✓\nVTDexManip(Liu 等,2025c) 2025 人类触觉 ✗ – – ✗ ✓ RH20T(Fang 等,2023) 2023 Real – ✓ – ✓ ✓ RH20T‐P(Chen 等,2025e) 2025 Real – ✓ – ✓ ✓ RoboTwin 2.0(Chen 等,2025d) 2025 Sim ✓ ✓ – ✓ – Action100M(Chen 等,2026a) 2026 网络视频 ✗ – ✗ ✓ ✗\nX‐Emb.:跨具身覆盖范围。Act.:显式动作监督或对齐的动作代理。Obs./3D:超越基础单目RGB的强观测支持,例如多视角、深 度、LiDAR或3D标注。Lang.:语言/任务条件。M/C:多模态或接触丰富信号,如力、触觉、音频或密集的本体感受/接触线索。✓表 